{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1248,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ab87ecf543ea49c759608a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我收到了刨冰大会的活动介绍传单！\r\n据说可以尽情放上各种水果喔！\r\n呵呵，真是期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8211e9477a77649de2180360d99f2239f9d6e6f72741e9d30d1a1419be4c5bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de1cbc51b0d48bd6150f9f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有一次，善信带着我\r\n去了夏季音乐祭。\r\n挤沙丁鱼就是在形容那种场合吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8363fbe0397a00e7e699d9bb38037bd942e66ddb0497a73beea4f5a211898378",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:235ce607c73cbe3e0c61fd31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奶奶是这么教诲的，\r\n即使早晨也不能输给睡意，\r\n要抬头挺胸……呼啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2b7743b38139ea9020cca07749952302b008b8646b017dfa794228f9a8f5c4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c5a9b59a08cd02073d357d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我拿到质量很好的茶叶。\r\n是「哈洛丝」的限定期间茶叶，\r\n很适合用来搭配甜食。",
      "source_fingerprint": "719a9123b780ef46102d76a466766b5bf4ad99aef92936d0aae1eae368d2e3f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e149b0b557c0003a214b71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哎呀？好像从哪里传来了\r\n烟火的声音……要不要去看看？\r\n……只要一下下，好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ffca8292c8392ea3eccd21db4dd2309d9678ed0cd0dec0f5934b5dac6bc3e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dee5510fa3942f5ddef1020",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种季节跑起外围真是格外舒畅。\r\n樱花瓣飞舞、油菜花飘香……\r\n下次要不要一起去散散步？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a669d584f2bcc8058c620f6452274853755e10928a24430924b7a57aa0aaf074",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00bae7b0d4c96f61a2c2fbe7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前阿尔丹的房间曾飞进一只迷途的\r\n萤火虫。不知为何我总觉得那萤火虫\r\n比在其他地方看到的都还要美丽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fd45f6f9deba10ec11d2e28feafe8a3fb49fe5ed0e5fcf1c3d83cf8e2eff3df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa1fd749a0dffda66e518500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金船朝着空中一直挖，\r\n说是要反向挖地瓜……\r\n我应不应该阻止她呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "946a9b550a6177eb2ba7eb26dd67a2deb687bd246baa409535b95fb8fb77473b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617907d4c2a2245a06743824",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我可是目白家的赛马娘，\r\n才不会屈服于这点寒冷呢！\r\n……绝对不会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eae1a3fc3af51a85c176ccf68cd5c2dd96d1de149d0629f9b1fe495ea4004e99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53689775ff739899abc804dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我选择了能遮住肚子的款式。\r\n那个……毕竟不怕一万\r\n只怕万一对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5c4e2e49e429427ed7e0e8e0b9fcef55bead38ffba30b5ddb4a3b766100b67d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b597760f9cb7619f6a6e2c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不可思议，只要穿上这套服装\r\n就能感受到那一天的夏日天空。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1697072bd1dc2714275cbb07b172c84836f7660ac17420ec348ffb0608388b60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efc472813faa5e6b9d9bdf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好了。\r\n可以下达指示了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "822433039b044819bcc9a920a299eb303a38089489695b34752681d786f616e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b46c5f6e69edaad499de3960",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきますわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1e86cae696f7fc2eda901391a9d4edb3ab4b3cdac405206139ed97f813c57ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:697a05a018d99c4787844fb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我身为背负目白家荣耀的人，\r\n绝不会疏于每日的锻炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42a223b660dbe184029931ab124988f9bbfbef6e1095e1ea2511eb5d20a528a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e25d3458f9f1cb2b5eeb96d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要一步一步、\r\n一点一点地累积努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bbe70a5195b6d7ce0836b29214e73dc44ad06285285c48b5e0077cb348f1733",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:702dcae75a2be456848866cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了有一天\r\n能够达成夙愿……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96cbc90508759c4e5b8a53c8b9681b5db67383651ae0e06598b710fc9e437836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbff111ff1a623efb5f7a190",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都说「早起的鸟儿有虫吃」，\r\n真想要好好利用早上的时间呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "571ffe3783d47285d0efaa1d5508cca754267d9cd1f1e837334f6540344c2e0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3715d9365554f773f36261a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "经过不断地努力才走到了这一步。\r\n今后也要继续照这样持续锻炼才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66fa9e04215ddb46e16934d6c77565f142a8ad9f39d0c6e0c5aa4a8aa74598a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c6d1260831b41de3e5a17d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要穿着这套决胜服取胜，\r\n来证明目白家并非浪得虚名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75e9e85b18ae19e12442ba21797958213c0f66a20842169ab2c69d60b2495535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0de7672d615c024be5387408",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "严苛的训练我也会撑住，\r\n不然是没办法取胜的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ca45ead3d2d41367927a3c34f4e08a2647763df01ff89f7215f7c134085355",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:420109c5375c057e2bffca8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了接近理想的跑法，\r\n今天也要请你多多指教了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9751767aea96be4c6161defd081b6af25dd44cff092d6eaa3938888ec91d33ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3129770a0334c0aad3300e86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你应该明白什么样的训练\r\n才能发挥我的长处吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c59bec3eadc17490b47e91482711da6d7bb651c1729b51fbe01a7e81a8adf9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905ae931c3b23766e03a96d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宛如水鸟一般，强悍又优雅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe76a99e44b3636d5e8ae5310fb18af4bff38cdf6c18a56c47ed0fb95f70029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dc7572e9ff4187c09f994d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们振翅高飞，\r\n迈向胜利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4908ccb317d2fc3fe617df7a9e55b4b1ad68018d89403c007cd2bf9ae115f532",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6f1861174abe845195c83fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里有很多可以互相切磋的对手呢。\r\n要好好珍惜……这样的环境。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d273f4183767d87ce2fd03a0575157abdc6317183d76030e4cfbc895244b6be8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:889ad9b7c28d2baa889fe72b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望自己可以常保平静，\r\n就像清澈无比的池水那样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b66a499a7d16812d6d3f65c1c4f6f9651d290e967377fb2e584f2b36b4213fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09ede406b09dd5c93ce1348b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未知的未来会发生什么事……\r\n就让我们两个人一起亲眼确认吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c6bb23116deb9bee5ccfad1fdde1bb6880e39187767440c2e70887f10e827b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18059f0701315b48b680bea0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经恢复精神了……\r\n来吧，无论什么训练\r\n我都会完美达成的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "572d1140be113f47fc143193de1215035acf027b595d3104b60614cdeedb03a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5514221948b6d34d1de0f596",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的没问题吗……\r\n训练员，要是我的蝴蝶结掉了\r\n请立刻告诉我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c00838efa6af9807b314548c1a1142e3e4d227716d5e5ac498dbf880deefa717",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e34245d157d3c52fa1d9ac1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要事关胜负，无论何时何地……\r\n都必须全力以赴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c801d5b4f614c4a2214b900e09e51b4f636cdef4c6db4b4ed952e2b243f197d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4712cd23cc2e42898cf31f2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也能够提出一些\r\n傻气的任性要求吗？\r\n……呵呵，开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33a678b11ff7f83a3bf4c3bf0b155fa6d30d2a6d72a663e41cce9c3d1bb00dc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c260bfcec86e8abb6d6d1e58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「身为目白家的赛马娘」……\r\n我会将这份骄傲铭记在心，\r\n但不受此束缚，持续向前迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6daffc80d2c4674e92add8c9d4eb3f7dcfefa92f094cb3aa0318478e827becfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfe8085dbf06a08a93f61027",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想亲手掌握的事物依旧没变──\r\n跟你一起……实现目白的宿愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f6d43f038e0944e6597e3203aea3bbb403a34532dad093062e9050dce94c97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30a83651f35e13725f763d4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真想让你看到那道夕阳……\r\n呵呵，我说的是累到精疲力尽时\r\n欣赏的夏日余晖喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98242a06461d1545b9b10e9e1daf23547452a09f26ce131cc2f3a72921f5003f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ee336e4eb0f6c8b37d9479a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这都是因为有训练员在我身边的关系。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8200c8b443fed32314359a45c6628f3a6a54601ff702a32d0f1d5ed4874f740d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ec4325f034df8584f46857b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为目白家的人，我一定会完成的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cf6b5f5bb3c87f8ee8c550586949665672753984dba421abf2c2cc35964a301",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97735a74eacc5479187cd951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将至高无上的荣誉和感谢献给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b7b2baf8123ee0d123a915ed14cc5d9eccbcbc6970aed828cb71b1cd8521122",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62f8c2b4c7834915c0355b06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的骄傲……便是与你同在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "675770642e56e39b1e5c931e4535a1e0d2180b1b8493003c06a2fa2496b30d33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:facb2ef022fb8f61f6f44d36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是怎样的我，你都予以支持。\r\n此事我会永远铭记在心的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b23e846e93e21b7709984addd52e7a910bf6da1ae1dd1f869ef237aa862df64c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1179c2bac406f1f9a7f7b437",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论训练还是假日……\r\n都充满着和你之间的回忆呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d373d42a78fdef9e96c238f6c62ee254d97d9dbf55ab05b3a616ec2b694a5e76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2229322ca833721d80f9714f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力量不断在涌现呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da62d4b14db8dc6d5c5497d5f25d44300d9ad464d0d8da615406c5cca24f660c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ab9702970648a6f70baf6db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会变得更强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "354f9c1bdad0527a44aabfb244dcc387688e45884337be55b968be43505c8fba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0bfbe5ae96d7ee827730559",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，我是目白麦昆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbf401e37ed694dba2d6329558d76778d917e550caba3fcf298eafd3053acd41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92c16237e0bbfd6db4d4f934",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利才是我的宿命，\r\n朝向天皇赏奖牌的荣耀，前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d8f1f6cb51c4eeb56c45d59572beca6b5a68aa4a5f2e241bedcd00c8e9c984f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7c2bfa16066946151489b2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我越来越能帮上忙了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d68457e7ad3f2ffe9e876c3892cc97a443ddec3b8425a6c20f006dc6f98e88b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7047f1ad2e3d7f52247b123f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要严格执行咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e94ae0c2b5d5c18924a0340b65a2d1e032eadb08090af831a52e699db0b6371",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d222257c9a31f30839977e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲破云霄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ff1103c5db0d2383f402454e9446ba3ef990e5e16754c1cf1cb1d91253071e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa276bf5081b371edb77068a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迈向无尽的远方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a393cbe85aea9aac69864cb96972898258bb8662b6e1caeb78a827b22bb48c7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673f053dccdf4512b0bd8ec4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会一跃而起！\r\n前往遥远且无边无际的未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "877898dc46b863b8f82fbd117821149e71cdd9111adc7bada7d338bf760044ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc35ed626aecb806f324d0fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是目白麦昆。\r\n我会一飞冲天的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "025b8e7326433b12f0690bea92855db65720dfa264455ab1454c8fed091c5ee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb0bf9234a72b08b33303413",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我充分地休息过了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d8b67f6fcaa8072de0ce4910818874cef106908fd3dd81d67b935ba95cef0dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d3373b473eb9040b28f006",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸中感到一股炙热，\r\n彷佛夏日的光辉……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86be60a7a23b947a1aabe6ed4a8d1edd3c5a1e625a509325d8adf962566dd447",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2fb88875d7820cceb0cdf61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想在海边漫步、踏踏浪……\r\n一下下就好……可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c848ac7d3221fe824c3764a1eeebf09c9b746938445e9e957408f02b81090c21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a39078d160a43588803659c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是目白麦昆。\r\n夏天有什么预定行程呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "46a9b32090c48912c5d082b939acfc69453c7d6b8c8043e747fea22ec683e948",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1223427aace14833947aac8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参赛Dea——th！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "996a5d7608e9a096b49aad20a534c9cdae3e8e0e153dba83e53b2858fa1f3c09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13ca2f7c900e58181136efcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最快，最棒，世界最强！\r\n而且是……你的签约赛马娘！\r\n神鹰，在此登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce3995e0d1315783ff98c9415eb09d6daa08372f65ba2d4d7602296f422636a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4490b2980cea91b539f2921",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきまーす！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69837289c7635e3064b0279c3a0bd4f9e960e089255e79dbfa1c219155568871",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9164f0c06e09b53fd83cb953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エル帰還しました！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "306e744e9bdb5e2300ce881603e487699e1c0ef301919047e43c1c10c1de1f3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62c1732bf7e0cd526121b8e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！和神鹰一起飞向世界吧！\r\n首先就从耐力跑100圈开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fed7a4672c366a7ddf54e1a2511d1a7ba04348c4c83b18b59ce0e0ef046af15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4c48bca09e1ced8aa13dd8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为世界最强神鹰的\r\n世界最强伙伴！\r\n你一定要一直都充满活力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a36009e789d355d344ddf3ec6009d550b660e281f76cf492b659a7efd75c2428",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e80f2d4ae069b3ca8150f186",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受到小草的邀约，\r\n我刚刚尝试写新年抱负……\r\n日本的毛笔真是难用Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1774a050e9585f259e1a6d3f790d1e0749f2d587a7b159784933fc0e0db7b55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ae3f8001606713afdcdb9e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！\r\n用来答谢你平时照顾的巧克力\r\n我等下就会拿来哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64a9447a55c71ecb9c18a7291a3e78417455a42cf40e8ca27ebb33bc2e634f7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096141bda5b6623fc99bf7a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请用！这是加了自制酱料，\r\n神鹰爸爸认证的辣味巧克力！\r\n我还是第一次送给家人以外的人Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bcfeb056eb62f0449f04243a0e0ddfc99831903aabab70f3a51d2e28545bc72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6c1d38bca2b9fe144dea5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你已经在签纸上写好愿望了吗？\r\n神鹰的已经完美，无缺，没问题Death！\r\n一起实现「世界最强」这个愿望吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "379b8b531650591698dcfef54e52bf2074e5985abb28d919ad03e1c53d92666a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d060adfbd8524a7ad3a406",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节快乐啦！Death！\r\n吃完甜食就来吃神鹰特制的\r\n墨西哥辣椒夹饼吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2225687ed0e654dd95341f9f29f96fa62017ce1509203ac1bb61b69b8fd28d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:976739a16af95128e2f7197c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前爸爸常常扮圣诞老人Death。\r\n神秘的蒙面摔跤手……\r\n没错，就是蒙面・之・圣诞老人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20bae9c62b7ac140325ce1301e066acdb228bee4b5e84f81b2558f87fe523cee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc13dc85fe17a9fad3295907",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "豪华，绚烂，圣诞树！\r\n和神鹰一起摆上最顶端的星星吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ae37b3412b403cfc9cd43df3d0e53bfd4c2bd39ed003461962c4c08eef05c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9dc45ccc11d501d7fc0dc30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利Dea——th！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "704cfe518877d700e40823358a07d49b3880604b6db05277e0e9bd916e2960be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3ca6927316960f424527c58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个时期……差不多要来了呢。\r\n说到年底，就会想到跨年摔跤……！\r\n我现在就已经开始等不及了Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d65db64b4774486720fae0abaca0b6d9de8d70863d9c8e1fbd50e0fe81e09e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b6d05e00fb315ff144d6df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n我请你到食堂吃\r\n神鹰特制的辣味炸鸡Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57c3f517edae9fffd9d3697183c90f40e1d1dc844dcda130f629c1909fc6f94a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1a95c2dd5a4a4f935aad899",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，我希望你今天能度过\r\nbueno！especial！\r\núltimo！的一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae1b8922daebc77a62fa36fb22d6f03542835a4bb31472ea13312b3d102518db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36fb36a29ab7c51684aefe94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Gracias！谢谢你为我祝贺Death！\r\n今后我们也要继续\r\n作为世界最强搭档在历史上留名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b70259376933c901a2f979b067a43c63600ce694c63c06a69b244fb0bbec9f4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dad267c1019bc153f120fa23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的爸爸妈妈打电话来\r\n祝我生日快乐了！你作为……\r\n神鹰最重要的搭档，要不要也说说话？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a85d61f0394229f9ed6184848dbf73b4d53a8c744f2daec53442193c264afdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbba8ef5974b7ab5704517ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到新公告了耶——！\r\n一起确认内容吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0051c423b41ca162eb4b213d5ad5e0b4ab7cdc8474d5b240ac56f49516f38e79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8bfe5f255094d8b93ff30f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了耶\r\n神鹰也很期待\r\n里面装着什么Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8aea2e49644a6b3079f75bb3a1ca5e1486340376177f61086ec64c61e6fd259",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee2780db3c317371620d8fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Bueno！\r\n好像有任务完成了Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd99a6fc833340508dc9efa4c4fe8bd09a4f8a7288edc356487e1f734621f8e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5725c3c9450ac8c9abd8565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就快要比赛……\r\n不对，是要举办活动了Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98543892f34726f457ac4323953ae74f99cb02b5282049cdebc0c51b46071685",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:effee3b8567c7fcb422f4725",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在好评举办中～！\r\n我们也不能错过了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8df5f6732d2db9099bb317b0d0f28a8b84f51edf48b19723aeb0a87a55ba5c90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cdfa61c78ba05f44648d253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不甘心Dea——th！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e1f694225bfc8ab6de3d2aefd487e0a73f44828219a53f26fe6d7e72b085518",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4688da6814eca7213bd8a1d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴等级提——升！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab738f857b8db5b30324659788ec3801f1dcd741a5e9a4a3ccbcd9396674f19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "10021"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
